          "originalCaption": "Fig. 7: A comparison of the second and third rounds of vehicle B. The second round is illustrated on the left, showing that the vehicle successfully navigated through the narrow gap. In the third round, vehicle B could no longer fit through the gap and stopped. Darker conditions and rainfall strongly contributed to the differences in the appearance of the BEVs over the course of the evaluation.",
